flowchart TD
 Shell[One account / search / workspace / Action Center] --> Discovery[Scoped workspace discovery]
 Discovery --> Console[Existing console extended]
 Console --> Inbox[Shared work items and approvals]
 Inbox --> Gate[Existing governance reconciled to proposed 14-check contract]
 Gate --> Commands[Domain commands / exact digest / idempotency]
 Commands --> Data[Canonical data + audit + transactional outbox]
 Data --> Worker[Publisher / retry / DLQ / checkpoints]
 Worker --> Rail[Regulated rail or approved institution adapter]
 Rail --> Reconcile[Authoritative receipts / reconciliation]
 Reconcile --> Data
 Data --> Projection[Scoped freshness-labelled read models]
 Projection --> Console
 Projection --> Portal[Approved immutable audience packages]
 Projection --> Agent[12 proposed observe agents]
 Agent --> Draft[Bounded handoffs / draft only]
 Draft --> Inbox
